Looking to try out a beat before committing to a license? Beat22 offers a **Free Download** option on select beats so you can explore, write, and vibe **risk-free**. But what exactly can you do with a free download? Here’s everything you need to know:

## **What Is a Free Download?**

A **Free Download** gives you access to a tagged version of the beat for **non-commercial use only**. It’s meant to help you **try before you buy**.

### **What You *Can* Do:**

-   **Listen & Write** to the beat privately
-   **Practice, record demo vocals**, or draft your verse
-   **Plan your project** before deciding which license to buy
-   Share ideas with your team, manager, or collaborators
-   Use it to test **vibe, flow, and fit** before purchasing

### **What You *Can’t* Do:**

-   **Release** the song publicly (YouTube, Spotify, etc.)
-   **Monetize** the track in any way
-   Use the beat in **music videos, ads, or performances**
-   Remove tags or claim ownership of the beat
-   Use it for **commercial gain** or publishing

## **Why Use a Free Download?**

-   Try out multiple beats before buying
-   Create solid demo drafts before investing
-   Shortlist beats with your team or label
-   Boost your confidence in picking the right license

## **Ready to Go Public?**

Once your draft is ready and you’re confident, **buy a license** (WAV, WAV + Stems or Exclusive) to release your track legally and start monetizing it. For any questions about licensing or how to buy, feel free to reach us at **support@beat22.com**
